3.7. The AI Guidance Principles must be considered in all stages of the AI system lifecycle
including:
(a) procurement;
(b) design, data and modelling (such as planning, data collection and model building);
(c) development and validation (such as training and testing);
(d) deployment (including the use of existing AI technologies);
(e) monitoring and refinement (including fixing any problems that occur); and
(f) migration or decommissioning.

